        <p>"Through reading a newspapr report of how nerve-wrecked man ha] been cured by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills I was led to tiy this remedy. " After taking regular doses of Dr. Williams' Pink Pills my sleep became more refreshing, and the dreams did not disturb me. In time, my appetit,t returnel. and food nourished me,so I regained weight As I persevered with this Pills my nerves calmed down and energy returned. After further treatment I was- not troubled with palpitation or breattdessni es. and all. depression pass l away. Then my blood ‘vas enriched. my circulation I nem.° normal, ad all trace of numb' ness disappeared. "My strength and vitality increased as I continued taking Dr. Williams' Pink l'ills, and my back was. properly strengthened. In fact I was soon like a news man. Dr. Williams' Pink tills are unquestionably a, strong blood and nerve tow and • ban to weak</p>
        <p>- Everybody interested should write for free Book:el Itiseases of the Nervous System."</p>
        <p>Because they do create New, Strong Blond *lnc feeds tbe enfeebled nervous system, Itr. Pink Pills are a proved cure for various firms tf Nervous lbsordeis. :M. bd. a box, or 13s. six, poet free, from Dr. Williams' Medicine C,. PI. flolliorn Viaduct, London also cf dealers, I.ut ask plainly at shops for Dr. Williams' Pink Pills, and shin useless substitutes.</p>
        <p>The Donut io Crewe railway works was acceetnaret on Monday by notices for the discharges of shout a hundred rti.n. For over two years workmen bare bees on short time. Recently they pressed for toll time and an elbround advent. of wagor, but tie officiate informed them that if the works were put on fall tiers there must te discharges. The men discharged oit Monday were mostly yi ung ten.</p>
