        <head>NURSING ASSOCIATION.</head>
        <p>NURSING ASSOCIATION.</p>
        <p>£l,OOO Legacy.</p>
        <p>The news of a .CI,OOO legacy was announced by Councillor 11. Roberts at the 14th annual meeting of the Warrington and District Nursing Association held In the 'town Hall on Monday evening, the Mayor (Councillor Dr. Joseph) pre:Ming. lbe Mayoress (Miss Joseph) ass also present.</p>
