        <p>BRITISH CROWN GREEN ASSOCIATION. LANCASHIRE v. YORKSHIRE. Over the green attar:A.l to the Ssndon Hotel, Liver- pool, on Saturday, the final firture in csonection with the British Crown Green Amateur AB3oCiali on Championship was concluded when the Lancashire and Yorkshire County Association met. J Fairhurst 41Amcsabire) wins the grid aggregate medal for the Staffordshire and Derbyshire match. and 8 Sladen that against Yorkshire. For Yorkshire, F Savory and P Eilner tied for the gold aggregate medal given for the best average against Lancashire, Cheshire, Staffordshire and Derbyshire. Results : LANCASHIRE. YORKSHIRS. J Gleave, Warrington 2l .1 West, Taylor Hill ... 19 Aahoroft, Wigan P Talbot, Newton.le-W 15 J Garthwaite, Dalton 21 .1 Grundy, Leigh El Connolly, Roebuck J Fairhurst, Charlton 21 H Exton, Newsome ... W Thompson, Liverpool 21 J Sawnsley, Bilged ... 14 E Thompson, Earrtoirn 17 F Savory, Cralock 2l J DiCkillllol3, Wigan l2 N Hannon, Lockwood 21 ' Guest, Old Trafford Slade°, Within! 2l A Cropper, De vsbury 5 H Baines, Liverpool lB F Roam, Lockwood 21 221 202 Aggregate scores : Lancashire, 442; Yorkshire, CA ; majority for Lancashire, 36. FINAL TABLF. _</p>
