      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-10-14_WidnesExaminer_art0057" n="art0057">
        <head>DRAW FOR THE FOURTH ROEND.</head>
        <p>DRAW FOR THE FOURTH ROEND.</p>
        <p>The draw for the fourth round took place on Monday evening and will commence to-day. Winners are requested not to leave the green, for immediately on the conclusion of the ties the draw for the sth round will tette place, and it is anticipated that this stage of the tourney will he completed. The comnittee have decided that winners of the semond round shall receive prizes, and a complete list of the same will be posted at headquarters. The draw for the fourth round iota follows :</p>
