        <p>INDEPENDENT ORDER OF ODDFELLOWS. " CONSTITUTION " LODGE.</p>
        <p>Lest Saturday evening at a social held at the Pelican Hotel by the members of the Constitution" Lodge of the Independ.nt Order of Oddfellows (Manchester Unity)the prizes in connection with the annual bowl,ng tournament were distributed by P.P.O.M. Bro. Coun- cillor Steer. The premier prize is a silver challenge cup,fpreaented by P.P.G.M. Bro. Steel, to be held for one year, and he also gives a good medal to the winner. The chair was occupied by N.O Bro William Warburton and V.O Bro Lawless was in the vice-chair.</p>
        <p>The prize list was as follows: laud coo bolder, 1, Bro W A Warburton ; 2, Bro .1 W Rigby; 3, 11,0 T Ford, 4. Bro W Lawless; 5, Bro W Taylor; 6, Bro G H Warburton Steel ; 7, Bro R Tilling; 8, Bro J W Pemberton; 9, Bro T James ; 10, Bro W Warburton; Bro 3W aivieo ; 12, Bro W Lee; 13, Bro H Taylor; 14, Bro F Rigby; 15, Bro Boll; If, Bro P Lester. A vote of thanks was accorded to Bro. Steel on the proposition of P.G. Bro. Jos. TURNER.</p>
