        <p>On the sale of any land within the rating Anthoi hies Area the said Authority shall be entitled to incrament on the same at the rate of 20 per cent, of the increased prim obtainel for such laud over the amount thst such land has bon need at, the total value being deemed to be 25 years purchase of the Annual rateable value after the required allowances have been made for improvements as provided is Clause I A. All such sums shall be paid by the seller of the Land and shall be carried to a fund for the reduction of the District Rate. CLAUSE 8</p>
