        <p>AN ALTERATION.</p>
        <p>Wa are informed that it is the intention of the Government when the Bill for the re-adjustment of local rating is introdueed on Tnesday next to move three new sub-elausei in place of those marked s(a be). The new once will reed : Land. (a) On the anntol value of all lands as 'sou- tamped in accordenee with Clause Is.</p>
