        <p>Before that time 1 was continually at home with it, and it is nothing but your famous remedy. Being only • working-man they have been a good friend to me. Again in thanking you, I remain, your own advertisement, F. HAYTER. FADE'S GOUT PILLS . _ .</p>
        <p>Are perfectly safe in their action, eliminate all injurious matter, and are highly restorative. Sold everywhere in Bottles, Is. lid. and 2s. 9d. or sent post free for stamps or P.O. by the Proprietor GEORGE RADE, 23% Goswell road,London. ELT MAT IC PILLS</p>
