        <p>JOHN AND HIS UMBRELLA.— No. 1. John was proud of his • , ;411111W10/11, Umbrella and carried it Hvlliaerrzetn this, b friends teased l:ini about John • had the laugh of them ) _ a little later. During a sea voyage a heavy 4 storm arose and John fell overboard. His / friends shed a Una?. y tear, never expecting to Alkkv see him again, but when '"'• the storm had abated, ' great was theirstirprise to see John safely Boated in his Um BRELLA • flying the signal of - distress. If you want an Umbrella like John's When John fell overboard. which was a WILSON'S UMBRELLA, We sell them from 1/3 to 63/ Repairs bg Competent Workmen J. WILSON &amp; CO., Umbrella Experts, 48 Horsemarket Street, Warrington.</p>
